---
// Footer.astro - Clean Oud Attar Footer
---
<footer class="bg-gray-100 border-t border-gray-200 text-gray-700 text-xs pt-14 pb-10 font-['Poppins',sans-serif]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10 pb-10 border-b border-gray-300">
      <!-- Column 1: Brand & Bio -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <span class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-xl font-normal uppercase tracking-widest text-black block">
          RABBI AZANDUNA LTD
        </span>
        <p className="text-gray-600 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light">
          Specialists in infusing Perfume Oils with our signature Oud scent to deliver a truly unique aroma. Discover our fine, long lasting range.
        </p>
        <p className="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">
          Hand-crafted in England • Worldwide Shipping
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: Collections -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-sm font-bold text-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          Collections
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-gray-600 font-medium">
          <li><a href="/collections" class="hover:text-[#ff2d3b]">Discovery Collections</a></li>
          <li><a href="/collections/oud-perfume-oils" class="hover:text-[#ff2d3b]">Oud Perfume Oils</a></li>
          <li><a href="/collections/extrait-de-parfum" class="hover:text-[#ff2d3b]">Extrait De Parfum</a></li>
          <li><a href="/collections/royal-attars" class="hover:text-[#ff2d3b]">Royal Attars</a></li>
          <li><a href="/collections/discovery-sets" class="hover:text-[#ff2d3b]">Sample Sets</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 3: Help & Info -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-sm font-bold text-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          Information
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-gray-600 font-medium">
          <li><a href="/collections" class="hover:text-[#ff2d3b]">Delivery & Returns</a></li>
          <li><a href="/collections" class="hover:text-[#ff2d3b]">FAQs</a></li>
          <li><a href="/collections" class="hover:text-[#ff2d3b]">About Us</a></li>
          <li><a href="/collections" class="hover:text-[#ff2d3b]">Contact Concierge</a></li>
          <li><a href="/collections" class="hover:text-[#ff2d3b]">Privacy & Terms</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 4: Newsletter -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-['Barlow',sans-serif] text-sm font-bold text-black uppercase tracking-wider">
          Stay Connected
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
          Subscribe to receive exclusive deals and private releases.
        </p>
        <form class="flex gap-2">
          <input
            type="email"
            placeholder="Your email address"
            class="bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-xs text-black w-full focus:outline-none focus:border-black"
            required
          />
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="px-4 py-2 bg-black hover:bg-[#ff2d3b] text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase rounded-lg transition-colors"
          >
            Join
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Strip -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] text-gray-500">
      <div>
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Rabbi Azanduna Ltd. All rights reserved.
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="font-semibold text-gray-600">Payments by:</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded text-emerald-600 font-bold text-[10px]">
          Paystack
        </span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded font-semibold text-[10px] text-gray-700">
          Card / Bank
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
